   "subject": "Re: about ggplot2",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">你如果把 itemValue 變成factor type, 然後把你想要的levels 順序定義好, 那ggplot 就會照著你要的順序. <div>不然, ggplot default 會把itemValue變成factor with default levels. Default levels 是照 sort(as.character(x)).</div></div>"
    ],
    [
